WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,920
Zhao Laosi

2
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,130
take what you see

3
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:04,650
Say it all once

4
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:06,480
The little one saw it with his own eyes

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,920
Fang Yang of Duke Cheng's Mansion

6
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,600
He said that he would take Erya as his concubine

7
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,360
Erya disagrees

8
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,960
Then Fang Yang asked his entourage

9
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,080
beat him to death

10
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,960
Bold Zhao Laosi

11
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,160
Dare to commit perjury

12
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,880
Are you really not afraid of severe punishment?

13
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,000
Sir, please forgive me

14
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,760
What I want to say is true

15
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,880
There is absolutely no lie. Then let me ask you.

16
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,440
You actively see it with your own eyes

17
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,480
Why can’t I tell the difference?

18
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,080
Which one is the son of Duke Cheng?

19
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,690
This old man is old

20
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,850
Maybe my eyes are too old to see clearly

21
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:36,610
But it’s not like I can’t hear clearly.

22
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:37,730
He Xuanhua

23
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:39,640
Sir returning home

24
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:42,090
I am the current General Zhaoyi

25
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:45,290
Xie Ping, son of Xie Lin, the Marquis of Yong Ping

26
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:46,650
Can't compete with fame

27
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:48,530
It actually happened with me

28
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:50,450
Have you ever thought that it was a human life?

29
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:53,570
I just see injustice on the road

30
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:54,890
Just saying a word to help

31
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:57,050
Mr. Fang, please don’t take the lives of people on your hands.

32
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:58,370
press on someone else's head
